---
name: Negroni Sbagliato
ingredients:
  - type: Campari
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Red vermouth
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Sparkling wine
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Orange
    amount: '1'
    unit: slice
    garnish: false
category:
  - sparkling
image: ../../images/cocktails/negroni-sbagliato/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.campari.com/en-us/our-cocktails/negroni-sbagliato/
---
1. Add Campari and vermouth to a glass with ice.
1. Top the glass with sparkling wine (at least 1oz).
1. Garnish with an orange slice.
